Grammar

    0 $accept: json $end

    1 json: value

    2 value: object
    3      | array
    4      | STRING_LIT
    5      | NUMBER
    6      | T_TRUE
    7      | T_FALSE
    8      | T_NULL

    9 object: LBRACE RBRACE
   10       | LBRACE members RBRACE

   11 members: pair
   12        | members COMMA pair

   13 pair: STRING_LIT COLON value

   14 array: LBRACKET RBRACKET
   15      | LBRACKET elements RBRACKET

   16 elements: value
   17         | elements COMMA value


Terminals, with rules where they appear

    $end (0) 0
    error (256)
    LBRACE (258) 9 10
    RBRACE (259) 9 10
    LBRACKET (260) 14 15
    RBRACKET (261) 14 15
    COLON (262) 13
    COMMA (263) 12 17
    STRING_LIT <string_val> (264) 4 13
    NUMBER <number_val> (265) 5
    T_TRUE <bool_val> (266) 6
    T_FALSE <bool_val> (267) 7
    T_NULL (268) 8


Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

    $accept (14)
        on left: 0
    json <node> (15)
        on left: 1
        on right: 0
    value <node> (16)
        on left: 2 3 4 5 6 7 8
        on right: 1 13 16 17
    object <node> (17)
        on left: 9 10
        on right: 2
    members <node> (18)
        on left: 11 12
        on right: 10 12
    pair <node> (19)
        on left: 13
        on right: 11 12
    array <node> (20)
        on left: 14 15
        on right: 3
    elements <node> (21)
        on left: 16 17
        on right: 15 17


